    "Question #: 2": {
      "Title": "Exam 70-466 topic 1 question 41 discussion - ExamTopics",
      "Question": {
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "HOTSPOT -"
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "You are designing a SQL Server Analysis Services (SSAS) cube that contains two measure groups named Sales History and Current Sales."
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "The Sales History measure group has the following characteristics:"
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "\u2711 Data changes on a monthly basis."
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "\u2711 The measure group contains a very high data volume."
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "\u2711 Queries that use the measure group only reference aggregate data."
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "\u2711 The measure group includes SUM, MIN, MAX, and COUNT aggregate functions."
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "The Current Sales measure group has the following characteristics:"
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "\u2711 Data changes frequently."
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "\u2711 The measure group contains a low data volume."
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "\u2711 Queries that use the measure group often reference non-aggregate data."
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "\u2711 The measure group includes SUM, MIN, MAX, and COUNT aggregate functions."
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "You need to select a storage mode for each measure group. The solution must meet the following requirements:"
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "\u2711 For the Sales History measure group, query performance must be optimized over data latency."
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "\u2711 For the Current Sales measure group, data latency must be optimized over query performance."
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "What should you do? To answer, select the appropriate storage mode for each measure group in the answer area."
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Hot Area:"
          }
        ]
      },
